    faq: [
      { q: '还要装 reka-ui 吗？', a: '不包。根是原生 div，编辑面是 Monaco。业务与文档站不要 import reka-ui。v-model、语言、schema 和 format() 语义与原来相同。', qEn: 'Do I still need reka-ui?', aEn: 'No. The root is a native div and the surface is Monaco. Apps and the docs site must not import reka-ui. v-model, language, schema, and format() behave as before.' },
      { q: '和 CodeEditor、CodeBlock 怎么选？', a: '只读片段用 CodeBlock。短配置用 CodeEditor。这里要 worker，适合工作台。不要首屏引入。', qEn: 'When should I use CodeEditor or CodeBlock instead?', aEn: 'Use CodeBlock for a read-only snippet and CodeEditor for a short setting. This one needs workers and belongs on a workbench. Do not load it on the first screen.' },
      { q: '为什么两个编辑器主题会互相覆盖？', a: 'Monaco 的 setTheme 是进程级的。同一页后创建或后切换的实例决定所有编辑器的语法色。auto 跟 documentElement 的 data-rs-theme，不是父级深色岛。', qEn: 'Why do two editors overwrite each other’s theme?', aEn: 'Monaco setTheme is process-global. The instance that is created or switched last paints every editor. auto reads data-rs-theme on documentElement, not a parent dark island.' },
      { q: '菜单为什么还是英文？', a: '查找、命令面板等 Chrome 跟着 Monaco 的 NLS 构建。默认英文。中文用官方插件 monacoZhNls。组件自己的可访问名称走 monaco.label，跟 RsConfigProvider。', qEn: 'Why is the menu still English?', aEn: 'Find and the command palette follow the Monaco NLS build. The default is English. Chinese uses the monacoZhNls plugin. The component’s own accessible name uses monaco.label and RsConfigProvider.' },
      { q: '能做 diff 吗？', a: '不能。这是单文件编辑器。Diff 是另一套 Monaco API，不要从 getEditor() 假装它是 DiffEditor。', qEn: 'Can it diff?', aEn: 'No. This is a single-file editor. Diff is a different Monaco API. getEditor() is not a DiffEditor.' },
      { q: '卸载后还会不会占着补全和 schema？', a: '不会。内容、焦点、glyph 和右键监听随编辑器释放。同语言只留一个补全 Provider，按 model 分发，最后一个该语言的编辑器卸载时摘掉。JSON Schema 按实例 URI 删除。主题观察器在最后一个实例离开时断开。', qEn: 'Does unmount leave completion or schema behind?', aEn: 'No. Content, focus, glyph, and context-menu listeners go with the editor. One completion provider per language dispatches by model and is removed with the last editor of that language. JSON Schema is removed by instance URI. The theme observer disconnects when the last instance leaves.' },
      { q: '右键能换成自己的菜单吗？', a: '能。contextMenu 默认开，仍是 Monaco 的剪切、复制、粘贴。关掉后 contextmenu 给出行、列、选中文本和指针坐标，用 RsContextMenu.open({ x, y }) 打开自己的菜单。', qEn: 'Can I replace the context menu?', aEn: 'Yes. contextMenu defaults to on, which is Monaco’s Cut, Copy, and Paste. Turn it off and contextmenu reports the line, column, selected text, and pointer. Open your own menu with RsContextMenu.open({ x, y }).' },
      { q: 'RTL 页面会把代码翻过去吗？', a: '不会。源码面固定 dir=ltr，避免列号和光标被书写方向翻过去。外框间距仍用逻辑属性。', qEn: 'Does an RTL page reverse the code?', aEn: 'No. The source surface is dir=ltr so line numbers and the caret stay put. The frame still uses logical properties.' },
    ],
